From 5f57926fb80dfbdd453c42ce40cc605a144c2598 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hayaksi1 <193020925+hayaksi1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 09:45:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Repair the test helpers and the factory splice the rebuild
 leaves behind

Four fork test files lose helpers every rebuild: MessagesPresenterTest's
aJoinedRoomWithInfo, ThreadedMessagesNodeTest's caption parameter on the
fake callback, DefaultVoiceMessageComposerPresenterTest's use of the old
FakeVoiceRecorder call assertions, and DeveloperSettingsViewTest's plural
event name plus a taller qualifier for the push history row. The merge of
search/room-search-screen also splices two lines of the branch's older
index-deletion block into RustMatrixClientFactory's coverage bootstrap,
cleanly and without a conflict, so rerere cannot catch it.

Fork-Feature: fork-tooling
---
 .../messages/impl/MessagesPresenterTest.kt     | 18 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../impl/threads/ThreadedMessagesNodeTest.kt   |  2 +-
 ...DefaultVoiceMessageComposerPresenterTest.kt |  8 ++++++--
 .../developer/DeveloperSettingsViewTest.kt     |  6 +++---
 .../matrix/impl/RustMatrixClientFactory.kt     |  2 --
 5 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

